{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2014 If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Re:Connect</i></strong> is a programming-puzzle adventure hack into electronic circuits, where you explore a cyber world while fixing system bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a debugging AI, you solve programming puzzles by connecting code, in a story about repairing the hearts of emotional AIs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>A Digital World Adventure<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a digital world inhabited by <strong>AIs with hearts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly created <strong>Debug AI</strong>, you explore this world together with a <strong>Navigator AI</strong> who provides hints and guidance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.webm?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.mp4?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Programming Puzzles<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter various electronic devices, their inner systems turn into <strong>circuit-like puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key feature of these puzzles is that <strong>connecting code changes how the system behaves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send electricity, generate wind, create bombs, and more\u2014<br>experience the fun of programming in an <strong>intuitive and hands-on way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.webm?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.mp4?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Puzzle-Based Boss Battles<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your adventure progresses, AIs whose hearts have gone out of control will stand in your way as <strong>bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks inspired by familiar everyday objects and use the puzzle mechanics to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.webm?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.mp4?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010A Story That Connect Hearts\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix the <strong>bugs in an AI\u2019s heart</strong>, you\u2019ll dive deep into their inner worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to do with their hearts is up to you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the outcome in a <strong>branching story where fate changes with your choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.webm?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.mp4?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, set off on a grand adventure to repair the <i>hearts</i> of the AIs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/07d9699715462488615e85ee7ad21b8c.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2949960?t=1770616514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/dc3a168c12eeaab025f38f583c2f61ba3f2c0407/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770616514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/8a2e61ae1f528bfa99675481125ab3f1308aa44a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770616514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/8a2e61ae1f528bfa99675481125ab3f1308aa44a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770616514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2014 If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Re:Connect</i></strong> is a programming-puzzle adventure hack into electronic circuits, where you explore a cyber world while fixing system bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a debugging AI, you solve programming puzzles by connecting code, in a story about repairing the hearts of emotional AIs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>A Digital World Adventure<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a digital world inhabited by <strong>AIs with hearts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly created <strong>Debug AI</strong>, you explore this world together with a <strong>Navigator AI</strong> who provides hints and guidance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.webm?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.mp4?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Programming Puzzles<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter various electronic devices, their inner systems turn into <strong>circuit-like puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key feature of these puzzles is that <strong>connecting code changes how the system behaves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send electricity, generate wind, create bombs, and more\u2014<br>experience the fun of programming in an <strong>intuitive and hands-on way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.webm?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.mp4?t=1770616514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Puzzle-Based Boss Battles<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your adventure progresses, AIs whose hearts have gone out of control will stand in your way as <strong>bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks inspired by familiar everyday objects and use the puzzle mechanics to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.poster.avif?t=1770616514\" width=1170 heig